// few hundred titles: its 9.0 x 10.0 m shell, doorway, hero wall (the two hero-wall modules, the hero corner, the
// featured wall shelf), one side-wall socket in the base room and one growth step of 2.0 m that adds one more, the two
// decoration sockets of the south wall (which move with the growth). No display case, no door-reserved socket, no
// corner decoration. The prefabs are the shipped ones (and the families' fixtures stand in its sockets as in the
// shipped template).
